# Exclude list for `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .`. The context is the repo
# root, but BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` first, so this lives next to
# the Dockerfile instead of at the repo root.
#
# An ALLOWLIST: a working checkout carries untracked weight (skillsbench/, pilot/,
# _site/) and a live graph in .jac/, and none of it belongs in an image.
*
!sigil
!jac.toml
!observatory.jac
!src
!docs
!web
!examples
!LICENSE
!README.md

**/.jac
**/__pycache__
**/*.session
**/*.session.*
web/node_modules
